X&_nc_oc=AdotdoNdTRN3eW7EZnjk6ObtnwOrjf0w_tNIzsA5RIuVTRoJw_DSt-NqylFMkMKf4Tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1o8HL63Pnj2Rdtmbs0u3JmT_Fg4c9jAQooKeGfngCEhg&oe=69EA2E8E"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "2167793816917307", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75530717_2167793820250640_7955545426742716187_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PDhv6MCO6xIQ7kNvwFT1eHk&_nc_oc=Adq3GkpkmiHwQ5WiR1oBtnt2yOL7XUwkbnYZ39hZZp8BM_wt4jHZ12xm6ADicxo-WbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1tq1sYv_d5lMv0Dbav8rAPPZuIi5WxrjY642AtHF2aNw&oe=69EA1CFF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "capyherolandscape.png", "id": "1104667157499303", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75542958_1104667160832636_8737034789958696015_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qgoCfuz5HgwQ7kNvwG3YbfK&_nc_oc=Adqzp-UP1LJeINhRdKgAPLGQKK_iIdWQUU4Z3BtPr45edekyQBYU8E00lKHyVEz0IXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2ZqdZ1t0NBfozckhOUUkPPsJBzK3iOmCk2xfLIyPgi_w&oe=69EA380E"}, "display_name": "Capy Oasis", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to the Capy Oasis! Here you'll find yourself shipwrecked in a paradise filled with some of the cutest, curious creatures in the world - Capybaras! You'll learn educational facts about these critters while you interact with them in a rich, immersive environment. \n\nIn the Capy Oasis you can : \n- Pet a Capybara with your own hands! The creatures react to your touch, the objects you play with, and more. \n- Learn about Capybaras! There's plenty to learn about these friendly animals, and Capy Oasis aims to educate as much as entertain.\n- Unlock the mysteries of the Oasis! This mysterious oasis isn't just a Capybara ecosystem, it's a living world with puzzles and intrigue. \n\nCapybara Capybara Capybara Capybara, Ca-py-bara! ", "short_description": "Visit the Capybara Oasis and inter